# Rendered from SOPS by `toolkit infra terraform gcp-bootstrap-tfvars` and
# deleted after every use — it must never be committed.
#
# It carries `billing_account_id`. Not a credential, but this repository is
# public and git history is permanent, and the `rm -f` in the Makefile is not a
# guarantee: a run interrupted between render and remove leaves the file in the
# working tree, untracked and — without this — stageable by `git add -A`.
gcp-bootstrap.tfvars
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
